#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:959
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Dynamic Mode feature is new to the 1.3 release. In this mode it is possible "
"to have &amarok; add tracks to the playlist based on a set of criteria. To "
"enable Dynamic Mode you can use the menu by going to <menuchoice><guimenu>"
"Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Dynamic Mode</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
". You can also go to the Playlists tab and click on the <guibutton>"
"Enable Dynamic Mode</guibutton> button. Finally, you can also click on the last "
"icon in the statusbar. Once Dynamic Mode is enabled in &amarok; you can go to "
"the Playlists tab and customize just how dynamite, er dynamic, your playlist is "
"going to be."
msgstr ""

